<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <title>Vacancy Request Approved</title>
</head>
<body style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; margin: 0; padding: 0; background-color: #f6f9fc; color: #333;">
  <table width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="background-color: #f6f9fc; padding: 20px;">
    <tr>
      <td align="center">
        <table width="600" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="background-color: #ffffff; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden;">
          <tr style="background-color: #0066cc;">
            <td style="padding: 20px; text-align: center;">
              <img src="https://mockurl.com/logo.png" alt="Pakistan Railways" style="height: 50px;">
            </td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td style="padding: 30px;">
              <h2 style="color: #28a745; margin-top: 0;">Vacancy Request Approved</h2>
              <p>Dear Employee,</p>
              <p>Your request to vacate the assigned apartment has been approved by the Pakistan Railways Housing Authority.</p>
              <li><strong>Application ID:</strong> {{uid}}</li>

              <p><strong>Apartment Details:</strong></p>
              <ul style="padding-left: 20px;">
                <li><strong>House No:</strong> {{apartment.houseNo}}</li>
                <li><strong>Street No:</strong> {{apartment.streetNo}}</li>
                <li><strong>Address:</strong> {{apartment.address}}</li>
                <li><strong>Colony:</strong> {{apartment.colonyName}}</li>
              </ul>
              <p>Please ensure the handover process is completed in accordance with the official guidelines.</p>
              <p style="margin-top: 40px;">Regards,<br><strong>Pakistan Railways Housing Authority</strong></p>
            </td>
          </tr>
          <tr style="background-color: #0066cc; color: #ffffff;">
            <td style="padding: 15px; text-align: center; font-size: 12px;">
              © 2025 Pakistan Railways. All rights reserved.
            </td>
          </tr>
        </table>
      </td>
    </tr>
  </table>
</body>
</html>
